+"""Crew Agent stage 2 gate, gateway area (Netie DR-0002).
+
+Every path that leaves the machine to a messaging platform asks the OpenVault leave-machine
+gate first, and every model-requested command asks the crew gate. Asserts what the operator
+or user receives: the CLI's stderr, the tool result, the cron delivery error, the runtime
+status the dashboard reads, the file a refused command would have written.
+
+Real gate transport (``netie_real_gate``): with no OpenVault listening the gate fails closed;
+tests that need an allow replace the transport themselves.
+"""
+
